Safe Space is a horror, comedy film directed by Annabelle Attanasio.

2
00:01:51,428 --> 00:01:57,428
A lonely young man uncovers a series of disturbing secrets when
he gets inducted into an all-male safe space.

3
00:02:47,142 --> 00:02:53,142
Conor Pfister, played by Owen Campbell.

4
