9
00:08:21,428 --> 00:08:27,428
No Safe Spaces is a 2019 American documentary film directed by Justin Folk that features commentator Dennis Prager
and comedian Adam Carolla talking to college students and faculty about university safe spaces.

10
00:09:17,142 --> 00:09:23,142
The documentary also covers free speech controversies occasioned when
conservatives are invited to speak in university settings.

11
00:10:12,857 --> 00:10:18,857
The film was released in Arizona theaters on October 25, 2019, and was
successful enough to have a national release on December 6, 2019.

12
00:11:08,571 --> 00:11:14,571
It has received mixed reviews from critics.

13
00:12:04,285 --> 00:12:10,285
The tone is lighthearted and dark.
